flowchart TD
    subgraph Client Tier
        Browser["End-User Web Browser (Chrome, Safari, Firefox)"]
        Mobile["Mobile Web Client"]
    end

    subgraph CDN & Edge Gateway
        Edge["Cloudflare / Render CDN (SSL Termination, HTTPS 443)"]
    end

    subgraph Application Container (Render / Docker)
        Gunicorn["Gunicorn Process Manager (Uvicorn Worker Class)"]
        FastAPI["FastAPI ASGI Application Engine (Port 8000)"]
        SSEConn["Persistent SSE Client Connections Pool"]
        ThreadWorkers["ThreadPoolExecutor Daemon Background Workers"]
    end

    subgraph Data & Storage Services
        NeonPostgres[("Neon Serverless Managed PostgreSQL (Pooled Connections)")]
        LocalChroma[("Persistent ChromaDB Volume (/backend/chroma_db)")]
        LocalSQLite[("Fallback SQLite Database (campusmind.db)")]
    end

    subgraph Third-Party AI Services
        GoogleCloud["Google Cloud Vertex / Gemini API Services"]
    end

    Browser -->|HTTPS / WSS| Edge
    Mobile -->|HTTPS / WSS| Edge
    Edge -->|Reverse Proxy HTTP/1.1| Gunicorn
    Gunicorn --> FastAPI
    FastAPI --> SSEConn
    FastAPI --> ThreadWorkers

    FastAPI -->|psycopg2 Pooled Connection| NeonPostgres
    FastAPI -->|Disk I/O| LocalChroma
    FastAPI -->|Direct Disk Connection| LocalSQLite
    FastAPI -->|REST HTTPS gRPC| GoogleCloud
